{"id":"n62281-6-3","stage":3,"title":"끌다 · 带领","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62281-6-3-1","ko":"저 가수는 공연 때마다 엄청난 무리의 팬들을 끌고 다녀.","zh":"那位歌手每次演出都会吸引大量粉丝随行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"가수는","meaning":"歌手","explanation":"가수：歌手；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62256","senseId":"1","lemma":"가수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가수는","audio":"/audio/9b3d7a366b46b683a5a1.mp3"}},{"text":"공연","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"공연：演出，表演","readings":[{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62459","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}},{"text":"때마다","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때마다","audio":"/audio/1e35b901eccff392fa42.mp3"}},{"text":"엄청난","meaning":"相当，特别","explanation":"엄청나다：相当，特别；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"엄청나다","audio":"/audio/d9539274e42f6bfd4c4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15118","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄청나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄청난","audio":"/audio/3fa20a2a133e63420fcf.mp3"}},{"text":"무리의","meaning":"群","explanation":"무리：群；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"무리","audio":"/audio/a7e5e35fac23a9526184.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15325","senseId":"1","lemma":"무리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무리의","audio":"/audio/3bbab357f0883c1b79b0.mp3"}},{"text":"팬들을","meaning":"迷","explanation":"팬：迷；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"팬","audio":"/audio/9b3eff87b9d553917511.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71314","senseId":"1","lemma":"팬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팬들을","audio":"/audio/c2f566d4170917ae9450.mp3"}},{"text":"끌고","meaning":"带领，引领","explanation":"끌다：带领，引领；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끌다","audio":"/audio/0b02d5ab7015ffd97e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62281","senseId":"6","lemma":"끌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끌고","audio":"/audio/294267c71d739bf78e32.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀.","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀","audio":"/audio/e3a1a0dcaf78067a8719.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"9e173c93773cc558","term":"가수","zh":"歌手","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3","entryId":"62256","definition":"以唱歌为职业的人。","pronunciation":["가수"]},{"id":"1c3a0a24ef01c77b","term":"공연","zh":"演出，表演","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3","entryId":"62459","definition":"将歌曲、舞蹈、戏剧等展现给观众。","pronunciation":["공연"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"d9539274e42f6bfd","term":"엄청나다","zh":"相当，特别","audio":"/audio/d9539274e42f6bfd4c4d.mp3","entryId":"15118","definition":"量非常多或程度十分严重。","pronunciation":["엄청나다"]},{"id":"a7e5e35fac23a952","term":"무리","zh":"群","audio":"/audio/a7e5e35fac23a9526184.mp3","entryId":"15325","definition":"多个人、动物或事物等聚在一起的整体。","pronunciation":["무리"]},{"id":"9b3eff87b9d55391","term":"팬","zh":"迷","audio":"/audio/9b3eff87b9d553917511.mp3","entryId":"71314","definition":"狂热地喜欢体育、特定的艺术节目，或运动员、演员、歌手等的人。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"0b02d5ab7015ffd9","term":"끌다","zh":"带领，引领","audio":"/audio/0b02d5ab7015ffd97e6e.mp3","entryId":"62281","definition":"跟别人一同前往自己要去的地方，让他们跟着过来。","pronunciation":["끌ː다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"经常出入某个地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a08c1d08f6123e563c66.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62281-6-3-2","ko":"팬들 중에는 아주머니들도 있다더라.","zh":"据说那些粉丝里还有不少中年妇女呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"팬들","meaning":"迷","explanation":"팬：迷；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"팬","audio":"/audio/9b3eff87b9d553917511.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71314","senseId":"1","lemma":"팬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팬들","audio":"/audio/7f7b7aa8bb658fbb0f2a.mp3"}},{"text":"중에는","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에는","audio":"/audio/e9bbf8696632882a7a7a.mp3"}},{"text":"아주머니들도","meaning":"大嫂，大妈，阿姨","explanation":"아주머니：大嫂，大妈，阿姨；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아주머니","audio":"/audio/32bc34ce0694e2e28fc0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89820","senseId":"2","lemma":"아주머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주머니들도","audio":"/audio/4b6785e670923d183693.mp3"}},{"text":"있다더라.","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；다더라：把以前听说的情况告诉对方，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":